	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "MEIHUA MHT151RGBCT reverse-mount 1206 RGB LED (common anode), placed on B.Cu with the lens up through the D2.1 hole. The library drawing is what the bottom-side viewer sees, i.e. the LED's BOTTOM view (datasheet p. 2): pin 1 top-left, 2 bottom-left, 3 bottom-right, 4 top-right (the datasheet's 'Recommended Solder Pad' drawing shows the lens-side view, which is mirrored). Same as marbastlib LED_MX_1206R. Pad numbers follow KiCad Device:LED_ARGB (1=A, 2=RK, 3=GK, 4=BK); the LED's own pins are 1=+, 2=B, 3=G, 4=R, so LED pin 2 sits on pad 4 and LED pin 4 on pad 2. Place at the MX LED position (0, -5.08) relative to the switch.")
	(tags "LED RGB reverse mount 1206 MHT151RGBCT keyboard backlight")
